  "hypothesis": "Guided OpenMP work sharing with chunk size one should reduce scheduling overhead across independent buckets while retaining opportunities for idle threads to take remaining work. Exact prefix-packed bucket ranges and heapsort also keep correctness and sort complexity robust when bucket sizes are uneven.",
  "notes": "Not executed; the controller evaluates correctness and performance. OpenMP parallelism is enabled only when there is more than one bucket.",
